notes.notes:
·Added a new neutral building [Ancient  Stele ], using hero occupation can earn global bonuses


·Added a challenging map called [Ritual Altar], utilizing knowledge from ancient civilizations to resist the swarming evil creatures


·The healing aura (Lunar Pillar/Sunflower) has been adjusted from health bonus to attack bonus; The upper limit of damage reduction is adjusted to 90%; The second architectural selection in evolutionary mode always leads to the emergence of high-end buildings now; The boost effect of the Cheer chip in the Sonic Tower has been improved, and the Sonic Tower can now detect and display hidden enemies;

·Evolution mode revision, chip upgrade changed to using gold coins for purchase; The difficulty of Endless Mode has also been slightly adjusted, and the specific balance is currently being tested

·Add new defense units [Naval Mine], which can be deployed on the water surface and explode when enemies touch, and rearrange them after each wave ends.; Several new exclusive chips have been added, including barrier-union chip, sniper-critical chip, mortar-gasoline chip, and   hammer-stun chip. Please check the specific effects in the game

·Balance adjustment: Strength chips and All-around chips will no longer appear in the stick to position mode, and Gift chip will not appear in all evolution modes; Now the skills of Hammer and Velonica can attack monsters lurking underground and expose them;

·Fixed some bugs;

· Added a new defense unit [Guardian MK-II], a powerful walking mech that can be moved to other positions for support when needed; 

· Added a new intermediate battle map [Mirkwook], which has no mineral resources and can only rely on initial and regular aid funds to build defense lines. 

· Balance adjustment: Unconventional chips in the upgrade route of defense tower chips (such as Hammer+Repair) will now appear in evolution mode
